<title>CHINA: Hero gets approval for rights issue.</title>
<headline>Hero gets approval for rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Hero Co Ltd has obtained approval from the China Securities Regulatory Commission to provide a 2.6-for-10 rights issue to all shareholders, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The price for the rights issue will be no less than 2.50 yuan per share, the company has said.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the rights issue will be used to develop new pen products and invest in subsidiary companies which produce kitchen equipment, doors and windows, it has said.</p>
</text>
